Package: ezp2019
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open-source driver and CLI utility for EZP2019 / EZP2019+ USB programmer
 EZP2019 is a Linux-based driver and command-line utility for the
 EZP2019 / EZP2019+ High-Speed USB Programmer.
 .
 It provides an open-source alternative to the proprietary Windows software,
 allowing users to read, write, erase, and identify EEPROM and SPI Flash
 memory chips directly from the terminal using libusb-1.0.
